<h1>Best fall half marathons in the Bay Area 2026</h1>{% updated %}
<p class="lead"><strong>{{ cal.fallHalves.length }} half marathons</strong> are still on the Bay Area calendar between now and December 31. The big three are the Golden Gate Half (bridge views), the Berkeley Half (flat and fast, mid-November) and the trail halves in the East Bay hills.</p>
<h2>Our picks</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>For the views:</strong> <a href="/bay-area/races/golden-gate-half-marathon-and-5k/">Golden Gate Half Marathon</a>, November 1. It crosses the bridge twice.</li>
<li><strong>For a PR:</strong> <a href="/bay-area/races/berkeley-half-marathon/">Berkeley Half Marathon</a>, November 15. Big-city race feel on Berkeley streets; online signup closes October 30.</li>
<li><strong>For trail runners:</strong> the Coastal Trail Runs and Brazen Racing halves in the East Bay and Marin hills. Expect real climbing and fewer people.</li>
<li><strong>For a low-key morning:</strong> the small Crissy Field series races in San Francisco run most weekends, with 5K, 10K and half options.</li>
</ul>
